            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>1. </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Contact Reason Level 3 </run>
                <run>= </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>defines different customer contact reasons level 3 of refund or compensation </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>&#9;i. </run>
                <run>Contact Reason Level 3</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>=</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#12109d'>More Than One Source</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>= when there is more than one contact reason level 3 of refund and/or compensation if the orders had more than one non-seamless experience.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>2. Refund and Compensation Source</run>
                <run> = </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>defines different sources of refund or compensation e.g OneView, HelpCenter, More than one type</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>&#9;i. </run>
                <run>Refund and Compensation Source</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>= </run>
                <run fontcolor='#12109d'>More Than One Source</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> = when there is more than one source of refund and/or compensation</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>**e.g orderscan have refund and/or compensation from HelpCenter and/or OneView if the orders had more than one non-seamless experience.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>3. Refund and Compensation Type</run>
                <run> = </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>defines different types of refund or compensation e.g Refund, Compensation, Mixed, More than one type</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>&#9;i. </run>
                <run>Refund and Compensation Type</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>= </run>
                <run fontcolor='#12109d'>Mixed</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> = when there is a voucher + refund</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>&#9;ii. </run>
                <run>Refund and Compensation Type</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>= </run>
                <run fontcolor='#12109d'>More Than One Type</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> = when there is more than one type of refund and/or compensation</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>**e.g orders can have a mixed </run>
                <run>Refund and Compensation Type</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>  + a Compensation or a Refund </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> or</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> another mixed  </run>
                <run>Refund and Compensation Type</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'> from either OneView or HelpCenter.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
